"tutorials.createAccount.step2.desc" = "Fill in the details for あなたの new 口座 and tap 保存.";
"tutorials.createCategories.step0.desc" = "In あなたの profile, select the カテゴリー section and create a new カテゴリー.";
"tutorials.createCategories.step1.desc" = "Remember that there must always be subcategories associated with a カテゴリー to be able to create it.";
"tutorials.createCategories.step2.desc" = "Creating subcategories is as easy as creating categories: give it a name, select its nature, and optionally modify its icon.";
"tutorials.createCategories.step3.desc" = "Customize あなたの カテゴリー's icon and color to あなたの liking whenever あなた want.";
"tutorials.createTags.step0.desc" = "In あなたの profile, select the Tags section and create a new タグ.";
"tutorials.createTags.step1.desc" = "Customize あなたの タグ to あなたの liking: give it a name, icon, and color.";
"tutorials.createRecord.step0.desc" = "On the panel, tap the + button. If あなた're a Yala Pro user, select Manual.";
"tutorials.createRecord.step1.desc" = "あなた can 記録 expenses, 収入, and even transfers between accounts. Exchange rates are calculated automatically in real time.";
"tutorials.createRecord.step2.desc" = "Fill in the required fields: amount, 口座, and subcategory. あなた can also 追加 a description and any tags あなた want.";
"tutorials.createRecord.step3.desc" = "Use quick shortcuts: @ for 口座, ! for カテゴリー, and # for タグ. Start typing to refine あなたの search within each shortcut.";
"tutorials.importData.step0.desc" = "In あなたの profile, select the Import data section.";
"tutorials.importData.step1.desc" = "あなた can import CSV or Excel as many times as あなた want following the default template, which あなた can download right there. If there's data in various currencies, it will ask あなた to select the accounts for each one.";
"tutorials.createBudgets.step0.desc" = "In the menu select Planning and make sure あなた're on the Budgets tab. Use the + button to create a new one.";
"tutorials.createBudgets.step1.desc" = "Give it a name, amount, and define the period: daily, monthly, annual, or one-time (for a trip, event, etc.). Customize which accounts, categories, tags, and natures あなた want to track. Turn on notifications if あなた want alerts at certain thresholds.";
"tutorials.createBudgets.step2.desc" = "あなた can 追加 budgets to Favorites to display them in the Panel widget. Choose up to 3 in あなたの preferred order.";
"tutorials.createBudgets.step3.desc" = "Remember あなた can always come back to 編集 あなたの 予算 by tapping it.";
"tutorials.createScheduledPayments.step0.desc" = "In the menu select Planning and make sure あなた're on the 予定 支払い tab. Use the + button to create a new one.";
"tutorials.createScheduledPayments.step1.desc" = "Fill in あなたの payment name, amount, note (optional), 口座, subcategory, and tags (optional).";
"tutorials.createScheduledPayments.step2.desc" = "選択 the payment day and frequency. Choose when the first payment will be and turn on notifications if あなた want to be notified on the same day or days before.";
"tutorials.createScheduledPayments.step3.desc" = "Don't forget to turn on the subscription toggle if it's a recurring subscription.";
"tutorials.createScheduledPayments.step4.desc" = "By tapping a scheduled payment あなた can see upcoming payments, those already made, and 編集 it whenever あなた want.";
"tutorials.createFavorites.step0.desc" = "Go to the new 取引 screen and tap the star at the top to create a new favorite.";
"tutorials.createFavorites.step1.desc" = "Fill in the fields あなた want to be pre-filled. 次へ time, simply tap the favorite and watch all the fields fill in automatically.";
"tutorials.editPanel.step0.desc" = "Go to the main screen where あなた see あなたの 支出 summary with all available widgets.";
"tutorials.editPanel.step1.desc" = "あなた can modify which widgets to see and in what order by tapping the customization button on the panel.";
"tutorials.editPanel.step2.desc" = "Remember あなた can always return to the default order by tapping \"Reset\" within customization.";
"tutorials.panelFiltering.step0.desc" = "Get the most out of Yala's interactive charts. Almost all panels are filterable by カテゴリー, nature, among others. Play with them and find what works best for あなた.";
"tutorials.panelFiltering.step1.desc" = "あなた have a filter bar where あなた'll see all the applied filters. あなた can remove them individually or all at once whenever あなた want.";
"tutorials.panelFiltering.step2.desc" = "In the different views of the app あなた'll see あなた can filter to あなたの liking with the charts.";
"tutorials.panelFiltering.step3.desc" = "Filters propagate to all views equally, so あなた can see all kinds of metrics for whatever あなた want to filter.";
"tutorials.panelFiltering.step4.desc" = "In some views あなた'll also have a filters section at the top so あなた can filter to あなたの liking or remove all with a single button.";
"tutorials.inboxApproval.step0.desc" = "If あなた're a Yala Pro user, when あなた make a 記録 by voice or image, it will automatically take あなた to the draft. The same if あなた used the Apple Pay 記録 shortcut.";
"tutorials.inboxApproval.step1.desc" = "Simply fill in the required fields and approve. The 取引 will be created normally.";
"tutorials.inboxApproval.step2.desc" = "あなた can also make voice or image records with multiple transactions. It will tell あなた how many drafts were created and guide あなた to the inbox to review them.";
"tutorials.inboxApproval.step3.desc" = "In あなたの inbox あなた can approve transactions, select Approve later to see them later, or reject them directly.";
"tutorials.applePay.step0.desc" = "Open the Shortcuts app and go to the Automations section.";
"tutorials.applePay.step1.desc" = "Tap New automation, select the Wallet option, choose the cards あなた want to use, and select Run Immediately.";
"tutorials.applePay.step2.desc" = "選択 Create new shortcut and search for Yala at the very bottom. In Yala select the Apple Pay 記録 shortcut.";
"tutorials.applePay.step3.desc" = "For 金額 select Shortcut Input and then 金額. Do the same for Merchant and Name respectively. Turn off the \"Show When Run\" toggle.";

